      "message": "test(ui): remove size and colour clauses from behaviour tests (#1990)\n\nMove size, alignment, and non-wrapping assertions out of fixtures_page\nand gcode_viewer into page_layout. Expose G-code cursor selection,\nProperties pane Role::Pane, and tool icon alt text through AccessKit\nso UI behaviour tests assert labels, roles, and painted textures\ninstead of pixel geometry or fill colours. Replace fixed pointer park\npoints in edge_click_modifiers and geo_row_hover with chrome_point.",
